    # FAWHA @ talk "Since Tarek's death, the Vulshan have re-organised themselves and begun aggressively pushing back against Khazahs."
    FAWHA @ talk "塔雷克死后，伏尔珊帮重组势力，开始猛烈反击卡扎帮。"

# game/data/world_events/events/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:33
translate zh ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_d1725403:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Without Tarek holding everyone together, the usual in-fighting has returned."
    FAWHA @ talk "没有塔雷克维持局面，内斗又开始了。"

# game/data/world_events/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:34
translate zh ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_dc35f411:

    # FAWHA @ talk "More and more factions are choosing sides, and I don't think it will be long before things become all out war."
    FAWHA @ talk "越来越多的派系在选边站队，全面开战恐怕不远了。"

# game/data/world_events/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:35
